  "description": "You Can Participate in the Public Testing",
  "body_html": "<p>We are entering into week 11 of the bull market, and it has been incredibly tough to test out the short screener. But fortunately (and unfortunately for others lol), we finally have had ~2 weeks of weak price action. Additionally, I have been able to tailor the short screener more for breakouts to the downside, with volume. </p><p>Full disclosure: <strong>I HAVE NO IDEA HOW THESE STOCKS WILL PERFORM</strong></p><p>Additionally, if the entire market starts rallying in unison (a common feature of, no shock, bull markets), it may not be an optimal situation compared to when we are in a confirmed bull market. So cut me some slack while we give this a go. </p><p><strong>Definition of success: Greater than a 10% profit within a 2 week timespan.</strong> Shorts are not something we HODL forever, but just like longs, we want to get into winning positions relatively quickly, and then let our stops do the rest of the work. Maybe we get lucky, and it trends much further. </p><p>We will circle back and update this in ~2 weeks. The stocks were:</p><ol><li><p>GLOB (2nd place favorite…though stocks at the top of the list on long screener typically do best)</p></li><li><p>SLNO (3rd place favorite)</p></li><li><p>PBH (least favorite)</p></li><li><p>HRB (least favorite)</p></li><li><p>SLM (1st place favorite)</p></li></ol><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://www.stocktokdashboard.com/\">StockTokDashboard</a></strong></em> <em><strong>|</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a></strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a> </strong></em></p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div>",
